_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":91659,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__zYLAAIAAAATMjAzMjE2MDcxMjM5MTM1NjQ0NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"365f4528456f830d9c6ac62deabe9d95b8ca350406a8dad04d204a16a85ec62e","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/AOC/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYZMm__zYLAAIAAAATMjAzMjE2MDcxMjM5MTM1NjQ0NQgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2029558337604317516","post_id":"2029558337604317516","platform":"x","author":"AOC","original_url":"https://x.com/AOC/status/2029558337604317516","published_at":"2026-03-05T14:03:09.712Z","published_date":"2026-03-05","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"I can ask! This is a boring (but relevant) process piece - if I’m not mistaken, the way this came to the floor was unusual. The rushed process prevented people from proposing constructive amendments, so part of it is up to the original authors being open to that. GOP controls floor and that’s why the process piece is relevant. How things get to the floor is a huge part of if they can get a successful vote in the first place and if they can come back again.\n\nIf this bill was eligible to be filed as something known as a privileged resolution, then you can bypass the speaker and bring it to the floor to trigger an immediate vote. If that was the case here then the answer is yes, especially if the original authors are open. There is a very small class of bills eligible to be filed this way, w…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1138,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"prov